      *****************************************************************
      * Sample Program 1:  Simple Query                               *
      *                                                               *
      * This program logs on to ORACLE, prompts the user for an       *
      * employee number, queries the database for the employee's      *
      * name, salary, and commission, then displays the result.       *
      * The program terminates when the user enters a 0.              *
      *****************************************************************

       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. QUERY.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      *(( PREPROC boomerang LINE BEGIN 15 ))
       01  SQLFPN GLOBAL.
           02  SQLFPN-FILE-LEN PIC S9(4) COMP-5 VALUE +11.
           02  SQLFPN-FILENAME PIC X(11) VALUE "sample1.pco".

       01  SQ0001 GLOBAL.
           02  FILLER PIC X(73) VALUE "select ENAME  ,SAL  ,COMM   into 
      -    ":b1,:b2,:b3:i3  from EMP where EMPNO=:b4".

       01  SQLCTX GLOBAL PIC S9(9) COMP-5 VALUE +802694101.


